sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as BillingManager
    participant Play as Google Play
    participant BE as Backend
    participant Dev as Play Developer API

    User->>App: buy Premium
    App->>Play: launchBillingFlow
    Play-->>App: purchase (token, PURCHASED) via listener
    App->>BE: verify(token) (authed, Ch 19)
    BE->>Dev: validate purchase token (Ch 23)
    Dev-->>BE: valid (+ sub details)
    BE->>BE: grant entitlement (idempotent by token, Ch 15) -> SSOT
    BE-->>App: entitlement = Premium active
    App->>Play: acknowledgePurchase(token)  // WITHIN window -> avoid auto-refund
    Note over App,Play: NOT acknowledged in ~3 days -> Google auto-refunds + revokes
